0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 669.00 Td (Cost-safety rules:) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 648.50 Td (1. Use AWS Free Tier where possible.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 631.00 Td (2. Use a small EC2 instance type such as `t2.micro` or `t3.micro` if eligible.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 613.50 Td (3. Use one region only, for example `ca-central-1` or `us-east-1`.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 596.00 Td (4. Set a billing alarm before experimenting.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 578.50 Td (5. Stop or terminate EC2 when finished.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 561.00 Td (6. Delete unused EBS volumes, Elastic IPs, NAT Gateways, and load balancers.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 543.50 Td (7. Do not create a NAT Gateway for this beginner version because NAT Gateway can create charges.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 526.00 Td (8. Do not upload secrets, access keys, or private SSH keys to GitHub.) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
