BT /Helvetica-Bold 12.5 Tf 56.00 571.00 Td (Q1. What did you build?) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 552.00 Td (I built an AWS Cloud Monitoring lab with a small VPC, public subnet, EC2 Linux web server,) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 537.50 Td (CloudWatch monitoring, alarms, SNS email alerts, and incident runbooks. The goal was to practice) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 523.00 Td (cloud operations support and monitoring.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
BT /Helvetica-Bold 12.5 Tf 56.00 502.50 Td (Q2. Why did you use CloudWatch?) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 483.50 Td (CloudWatch is AWS's native monitoring service. It collects metrics, logs, alarms, and dashboards) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 469.00 Td (so support teams can detect performance or availability issues.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
BT /Helvetica-Bold 12.5 Tf 56.00 448.50 Td (Q3. What is the difference between a metric and a log?) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 429.50 Td (A metric is numerical time-series data, such as CPU utilization or network packets. A log is) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 415.00 Td (text/event data, such as web server access logs or error logs. Metrics are good for thresholds) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 400.50 Td (and dashboards. Logs are good for investigation.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
BT /Helvetica-Bold 12.5 Tf 56.00 380.00 Td (Q4. How would you troubleshoot an EC2 instance that is unreachable?) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 361.00 Td (I would check the instance state, status checks, public IP, security group rules, subnet route) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 346.50 Td (table, internet gateway, network ACLs, key pair, username, and OS firewall/service status.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
BT /Helvetica-Bold 12.5 Tf 56.00 326.00 Td (Q5. How did you control AWS costs?) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 307.00 Td (I created a small lab using Free Tier-sized resources, configured a budget alert, avoided NAT) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
